{
  "name": "Enrich new CRM companies on creation (HubSpot / Pipedrive)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Real-time CRM Company Enrichment\n\nTriggers whenever a new company is created in HubSpot or Pipedrive. Extracts the company domain, crawls for emails and phone numbers, and updates company properties.\n\n## Setup (once)\n\n**1. Get an Apify token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. Create the n8n credential**\nCredentials → New → **Header Auth**\n- Name: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\nEvery HTTP node here points at that credential by name. No token is stored in this file.\n\n## Cost\n\nPay-per-event: $0.006 per domain where a contact (email or phone) is found (down to $0.003 on Gold tier, from $3.00 per 1,000). Blocked, unreachable, and zero-contact domains are completely free.\n\nCurrent pricing: https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder/pricing\n\nActor: https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder\nTemplates & docs: https://github.com/sumitrmardy/website-contact-finder-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t2-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "event": "company.created",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t2-trigger",
      "name": "New Company Created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspotTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~website-contact-finder/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: [ $json.properties && $json.properties.domain ? $json.properties.domain.value : $json.domain ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "t2-find",
      "name": "Find contacts (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "149c2e0f-7818-497a-9ee6-d955bcd22595",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "contacts_found",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t2-filter",
      "name": "Filter contacts found",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "company",
        "operation": "update",
        "companyId": "={{ $('New Company Created').item.json.objectId || $('New Company Created').item.json.id }}",
        "updateFields": {
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "phone",
                "value": "={{ ($json.phones && $json.phones[0] && ($json.phones[0].e164 || $json.phones[0].raw)) || '' }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "t2-update-crm",
      "name": "Update Company in CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New Company Created": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Find contacts (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Find contacts (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter contacts found",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter contacts found": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Company in CRM",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
